			<div class="content" id="post-content-3767542">
									

<p>&quot;They&quot; technically is the third-person, gender neutral pronoun you are looking for. It has historical precedence. But so too does &quot;he&quot;. However, that's only in regards to people, because &quot;it&quot; is considered to be dehumanizing.</p>
<p>All the more reason to use it! SCPs are not supposed to be referred to in their documentation by gendered pronouns because, from a logistical standpoint, they aren't people to the Foundation. At the very least, it makes the Ethics Committee feel less terrible before they opiod themselves to sleep at night.</p>

